      "claimClass": "abstract-explanation",
      "requiresFactCheck": false,
      "factCheckId": null,
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "从纸艺流程返回本人，由本人承担人机分工结论。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "B28",
      "order": 28,
      "scriptQuote": "这里可能有人会问，如果AI只是改变了效率和成本，那它最终会让所有行业变成卷价格的“红海”吗？",
      "rhetoricalRole": "audience-objection",
      "claimClass": "presenter-expression",
      "requiresFactCheck": false,
      "factCheckId": null,
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "向观众提出质疑时需要本人目光和停顿。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "B29",
      "order": 29,
      "scriptQuote": "这个担忧来自一个常见的误解。集装箱并没有让所有港口的收费趋同，但让那些能处理更大吞吐量的港口获得了绝对优势。",
      "rhetoricalRole": "port-competition-claim",
      "claimClass": "factual-claim",
      "requiresFactCheck": true,
      "factCheckId": "F17",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "港口收费与绝对优势需要核验，必要时只在真人旁放小型来源卡，不再增加整段素材。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "B30",
      "order": 30,
      "scriptQuote": "AI也一样，当连接成本趋近于零，企业之间的竞争就会从“谁更擅长找到客户”变成“谁更擅长理解客户”。",
      "rhetoricalRole": "competition-dimension-shift",
      "claimClass": "factual-claim",
      "requiresFactCheck": true,
      "factCheckId": "F19",
      "primaryRoute": "paper-editorial",
      "routeCueId": "P07",
      "decisionReason": "竞争维度从左轨切到右轨是抽象关系，纸艺轨道切换能准确说明作者推论。",
      "viewerGain": "explain-mechanism"
    },
    {
      "id": "B31",
      "order": 31,
      "scriptQuote": "这就是效率革命的特征：它让所有人都能低价获得同一种能力，于是把“做得更好”的要求推到了一个新的维度。",
      "rhetoricalRole": "efficiency-revolution-generalization",
      "claimClass": "factual-claim",
      "requiresFactCheck": true,
      "factCheckId": "F18",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "这是面向观众的归纳，保留本人；‘所有人、低价、同一种能力’需要核验或收窄。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "B32",
      "order": 32,
      "scriptQuote": "那些担心被AI取代的人和指望靠AI一夜暴富的人，其实犯了同一个错误：他们都在期待一个全新的秩序从天而降。然而事实上，旧的秩序只是在被重新打磨，水还是水，不过是流得更快了。",
      "rhetoricalRole": "closing-reframe",
      "claimClass": "presenter-expression",
      "requiresFactCheck": false,
      "factCheckId": null,
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "结尾重构依赖本人表情和语气，不再插片抢掉收束。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "B33",
      "order": 33,
      "scriptQuote": "至于水流本身，它从来不会在意谁在游泳。",
      "rhetoricalRole": "closing-line",
      "claimClass": "presenter-expression",
      "requiresFactCheck": false,
      "factCheckId": null,
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "decisionReason": "最后金句留给本人直说，画面保持干净。",
      "viewerGain": "presenter-trust"
    },
    {
